; The pouch, straight open -- I on the keyboard, SELECT (button 4, "Back") on
; the pad. It is the same menu `pause` opens, entered one screen deeper, because
; "what am I carrying and can I afford to leave" is the question players ask
; between every room and it should not cost two presses and a focus move.
;
; Select is the right pad button for it: it is the only face-adjacent button
; nothing else wanted, and every game that has an inventory puts it there.
